export const HELP_ZH = "======== 命令 / 缩写 / 错误码速查（加密 BLE · Lite/Pro）========\nGATT：服务 0xA003   写 0xC313   读快照 0xC314   通知 0xC315\nPIN：机身 8 位数字（仅 0-9）。SN：通常从广播名 MODEL-SN 取后半段（12 hex）。\n建链前：明文 JSON 握手。建链后：业务必须套加密信封 {nonce,ct,tag}（AES-128-CCM，tag=8）。\n不要使用明文通道 UUID：A002 / C303 / C304 / C305。\n\n-------- 安全握手（明文阶段，写 C313，应答 Notify C315）--------\nble-crypto-ver     {\"cmd\":\"ble-crypto-ver\"}\n                   成功 d.ver（如 BT_Crypto_V1）、d.step（0/1/2/3）\nble-crypto-reset   {\"cmd\":\"ble-crypto-reset\"}  仅 step=0 或 1；不清除已落盘 LTK\nble-crypto-jpake-round1  带 client_nonce(16 hex) + client_round1(Base64)\n                   过长可分片 client_round1_part / part_idx / part_total；设备可回 server_round1_part + fetch_next\nble-crypto-jpake-round2  {\"cmd\":\"ble-crypto-jpake-round2\",\"client_round2\":\"...\"}\n                   成功后 step=3，可发加密业务；LTK 落盘须待 Wi-Fi STA 成功\nble-crypto-session-nonce  step=2 时用已缓存 LTK 恢复：{\"cmd\":\"ble-crypto-session-nonce\",\"client_nonce\":\"...\"}\n\nstep 含义：0 等 round1；1 等 round2；2 有 LTK 等 session-nonce；3 已建链可加密业务\n\n-------- 加密信封（建链后）--------\n写出：明文业务 JSON → AES-CCM → {\"nonce\":计数器(uint32),\"ct\":Base64,\"tag\":Base64}\n读入：同上解包。nonce 须严格大于设备已接受值，否则 replay detected\ndecrypt failed = CCM 失败（密钥/密文/计数器不一致）\nevent=secure 且 ok=false：固件侧安全层错误，优先看 msg\n\n-------- 业务命令（解锁=建链成功后，语义同明文客户文档，但走加密信封）--------\nwifi     {\"cmd\":\"wifi\",\"ssid\":\"...\",\"pass\":\"...\"}  ssid/pass ≤64；可选 enableble / enablehttps（详见业务命令参考 §2.2）\n         成功 WIFI successfully（开始连路由，不等于已拿到 DHCP）\nwifiscan / getwifilist  同明文；列表 d.list=\"ssid|rssi,...\"\nread     {\"cmd\":\"read\"}  然后 GATT Read C314（密文快照需解密）\nrestart / location / zero / reset / deviceName\nmodel / getFunctionMap / mqttdata / udpdata\nenablehttp / enablewebsocket / enablemodbustcp / enabletls / enablehttps（Lite/Pro 能力见 Overview 矩阵）\nmqtt / mqtr / topic1 / topic2 / udp / deleteudp\nmodbus   {\"cmd\":\"modbus\",\"baud\":9600,\"parityStop\":0,\"address\":1}\n         parityStop 0=N81  1=E81  2=O81  3=N82；当前 485 参数见 model.d.MAD\ncheckota / otaprogress / startota / setInterval / getInterval\n【注意】加密通道没有明文版的 cmd=pass；建链即门禁。\n\n-------- functionMap 位（bit15 最高）--------\nbit15 Modbus TCP     bit14 TLS（常给 Modbus）\nbit13 UDP            bit11 WebSocket   bit10 WebSocket TLS\nbit9  MQTT           bit7  HTTP :80    bit5 LoRaWAN\n例：128 = 仅 HTTP；HTTP+MQTT = 640；32896 = Modbus TCP + HTTP。\n\n-------- 配置快照 model.d 缩写 --------\nWN SSID  WPN 显示名  MH/MP/MC/MI/MS MQTT  MF 布尔已连\nLSM 弱信号  UI UDP ms  WI WS ms  TS Modbus TLS  MAD 485\n\n-------- 读特征 C314 --------\nIP / RSSI / FW / SN / TP + 电参字符串。单位：V / A / kW / kWh / Hz\n按键是否存在解析单相 V/I/P… 或三相 VX/VY/VZ…\n\n-------- 握手失败 msg（明文应答，无固定 code 表时以 msg 为准）--------\nconnection key must be 8 digits\ndevice locked / version required / invalid step\ninvalid round1 / invalid round2\nround1 verify failed / round2 verify failed\nshared key derive failed / ltk derive failed / session derive failed\nreplay detected / decrypt failed\n\n-------- 业务错误码（与明文通道同类；成功无 code；重叠码看 msg）--------\n1002 Please unlock（若仍出现：会话未就绪）\n1003 Password Error（明文 pass 遗留；加密通道以 PIN/ZKP 失败为准）\n1014 functionMap error\n1015 unknow cmd\n1018 Error wifi ssid/pass required!\n1019 Error wifi length!\n1021 Error mqtt data empty!\n1024 UDP full   1025 UDP not found\n1043 scan busy  1044 scan not ready\n1050 payload too large\nillegal cmd / unsupported / timeout";
export const HELP_EN = "======== Commands / abbreviations / errors (secured BLE · Lite/Pro) ========\nGATT: service 0xA003   write 0xC313   read snapshot 0xC314   notify 0xC315\nPIN: 8 digits on the meter body (0-9). SN: usually the part after '-' in the advertised name MODEL-SN (12 hex).\nBefore the channel is up: plaintext JSON handshake. After: every business message is an envelope {nonce,ct,tag} (AES-128-CCM, tag=8).\nNever use the plaintext UUIDs A002 / C303 / C304 / C305.\n\n-------- Secure handshake (plaintext phase; write C313, replies on C315) --------\nble-crypto-ver     {\"cmd\":\"ble-crypto-ver\"}\n                   success: d.ver (e.g. BT_Crypto_V1), d.step (0/1/2/3)\nble-crypto-reset   {\"cmd\":\"ble-crypto-reset\"}  only at step 0 or 1; does not erase a persisted LTK\nble-crypto-jpake-round1  carries client_nonce (16 hex) + client_round1 (Base64)\n                   long payloads are chunked: client_round1_part / part_idx / part_total; device may reply server_round1_part + fetch_next\nble-crypto-jpake-round2  {\"cmd\":\"ble-crypto-jpake-round2\",\"client_round2\":\"...\"}\n                   success -> step=3, encrypted business allowed; LTK is persisted only after Wi-Fi STA success\nble-crypto-session-nonce  at step=2, resume with the cached LTK: {\"cmd\":\"ble-crypto-session-nonce\",\"client_nonce\":\"...\"}\n\nstep: 0 wait round1; 1 wait round2; 2 LTK present, wait session-nonce; 3 channel up, encrypted business OK\nstep=3 holds for THIS GATT connection only. If you see step=3 without a local session: disconnect and reconnect, never repeat J-PAKE.\n\n-------- Envelope (after the channel is up) --------\noutgoing: plaintext business JSON -> AES-CCM -> {\"nonce\":counter(uint32),\"ct\":Base64,\"tag\":Base64}\nincoming: same, unwrap. nonce must be strictly greater than the value the device last accepted, else replay detected\ndecrypt failed = CCM failure (key / ciphertext / counter mismatch)\nevent=secure with ok=false: security-layer error from the firmware; read msg first\n\n-------- Business commands (after the handshake; same JSON as plaintext, wrapped in an envelope) --------\nwifi     {\"cmd\":\"wifi\",\"ssid\":\"...\",\"pass\":\"...\"}  ssid/pass <=64; optional enableble / enablehttps (see Business Command Reference 2.2)\n         success: WIFI successfully (router join started, not necessarily a DHCP lease yet)\nwifiscan / getwifilist  same as plaintext; list d.list=\"ssid|rssi,...\"\nread     {\"cmd\":\"read\"}  then GATT Read C314 (decrypt the snapshot)\nrestart / location / zero / reset / deviceName\nmodel / getFunctionMap / mqttdata / udpdata\nenablehttp / enablewebsocket / enablemodbustcp / enabletls / enablehttps (Lite/Pro capabilities: see the Overview matrix)\nmqtt / mqtr / topic1 / topic2 / udp / deleteudp\nmodbus   {\"cmd\":\"modbus\",\"baud\":9600,\"parityStop\":0,\"address\":1}\n         parityStop 0=N81  1=E81  2=O81  3=N82; read back the current 485 settings from model.d.MAD\ncheckota / otaprogress / startota / setInterval / getInterval\n[Note] There is no plaintext cmd=pass on this channel; the handshake is the gate.\n\n-------- functionMap bits (bit15 is the highest) --------\nbit15 Modbus TCP     bit14 TLS (usually with Modbus)\nbit13 UDP            bit11 WebSocket   bit10 WebSocket TLS\nbit9  MQTT           bit7  HTTP :80    bit5 LoRaWAN\ne.g. 128 = HTTP only; HTTP+MQTT = 640; 32896 = Modbus TCP + HTTP.\n\n-------- model.d short keys --------\nWN SSID  WPN display name  MH/MP/MC/MI/MS MQTT host/port/clientId/interval ms/TLS  MF bool connected\nLSM weak-signal mode  UI UDP ms  WI WebSocket ms  TS Modbus TLS mux  MAD 485 address/baud/parity\n\n-------- Read characteristic C314 --------\nIP / RSSI / FW / SN / TP + electrical readings as strings. Units: V / A / kW / kWh / Hz\nParse by \"does the key exist\": single-phase V/I/P... or three-phase VX/VY/VZ...\n\n-------- Handshake failure msg (plaintext reply; no fixed code table, rely on msg) --------\nconnection key must be 8 digits\ndevice locked / version required / invalid step\ninvalid round1 / invalid round2\nround1 verify failed / round2 verify failed\nshared key derive failed / ltk derive failed / session derive failed\nreplay detected / decrypt failed\n\n-------- Business error codes (same table as plaintext; success has no code; rely on msg when codes overlap) --------\n1002 Please unlock (if it still appears: session not ready)\n1014 functionMap error\n1015 unknow cmd\n1018 Error wifi ssid/pass required!\n1019 Error wifi length!\n1021 Error mqtt data empty!\n1024 UDP full   1025 UDP not found\n1043 scan busy  1044 scan not ready\n1050 payload too large\nillegal cmd / unsupported / timeout";
